ds": ["2117761745666093087"], "id": "2117761745666093087", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 6034, "like_count": 37, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 8}, "text": "The interstellar medium, a thin fog filling our universe, seems to be much less stable than we previously thought. This could help researchers answer questions about how quickly stars can form.\nhttps://t.co/RHSGSVZQY0", "url": "https://x.com/QuantaMagazine/status/2117761745666093087"}, {"author_id": "860158302", "created_at": "2026-11-03T22:53:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117751930709479544"], "id": "2117751930709479544", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 20, "impression_count": 7421, "like_count": 59, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 12}, "text": "“Fusion in general has been a graveyard of dreams. I grew up on the dream it evoked.” https://t.co/JIwpNuzgfT", "url": "https://x.com/QuantaMagazine/status/2117751930709479544"}, {"author_id": "3290364847", "created_at": "2026-11-03T22:38:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117748268113309700"], "id": "2117748268113309700", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1980, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Voters across the country are furious over the high cost of health care, with resentment rippling across workers who get health coverage through their jobs. https://t.co/adygMAaJig", "url": "https://x.com/statnews/status/2117748268113309700"}, {"author_id": "32372834", "created_at": "2026-11-03T22:29:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117745894728560740"], "id": "2117745894728560740", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 11, "impression_count": 14429, "like_count": 32, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "To mathematicians, the torrent of breakthroughs artificial intelligence has catalyzed in their field has been head-spinning.\n\nOften running hundreds of pages, the new proofs can be so dense as to be nearly incomprehensible. To reassure mathematicians they are correct, #AI https://t.co/FboF0kPQK6", "url": "https://x.com/ScienceMagazine/status/2117745894728560740"}, {"author_id": "860158302", "created_at": "2026-11-03T21:46:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117735070756749345"], "id": "2117735070756749345", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 23, "impression_count": 7748, "like_count": 75, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 9}, "text": "Mathematicians have heated disagreements over which is the best voting system. The reality is that all of them are mathematically flawed. Tune in to The Quanta Podcast to learn why the math of democracy never quite works out. https://t.co/dSdj90U3oG", "url": "https://x.com/QuantaMagazine/status/2117735070756749345"}, {"author_id": "28164923", "created_at": "2026-11-03T21:27:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117730490316636542"], "id": "2117730490316636542", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7183, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Operating AI data centers isn’t any easier for companies that swapped out their bitcoin-mining servers for greener pastures https://t.co/uYmoPrLcRo", "url": "https://x.com/WSJmarkets/status/2117730490316636542"}, {"author_id": "28164923", "created_at": "2026-11-03T21:23:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117729334139969659"], "id": "2117729334139969659", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 11206, "like_count": 19, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "U.S. Stocks Mixed Amid Midterm, Iran War Nerves https://t.co/IkRTlp1f5y", "url": "https://x.com/WSJmarkets/status/2117729334139969659"}, {"author_id": "3290364847", "created_at": "2026-11-03T21:11:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117726363360632865"], "id": "2117726363360632865", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2341, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Servier reports a surprise setback for a drug being tested for a form of muscular dystrophy that lacks treatment. https://t.co/2xW06bKAtp", "url": "https://x.com/statnews/status/2117726363360632865"}, {"author_id": "14499829", "created_at": "2026-11-03T21:00:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117723618373181598"], "id": "2117723618373181598", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 14, "impression_count": 35121, "like_count": 98, "quote_count": 9, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 48}, "text": "Older adults, people with chronic conditions, pregnant women, and young children are at higher risk of severe disease and death from #influenza and #COVID19.  \n\nSimple actions can make a big difference in keeping you and your loved ones safe this season. https://t.co/5S9DZ4WHSb", "url": "https://x.com/WHO/status/2117723618373181598"}, {"author_id": "3290364847", "created_at": "2026-11-03T20:42:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117719180807921843"], "id": "2117719180807921843", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 4480, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A cryptic email sent to Mass General Brigham employees by the health system's CEO is stirring staff anxiety less than two weeks after a round of layoffs. https://t.co/larqC3zXQt", "url": "https://x.com/statnews/status/2117719180807921843"}, {"author_id": "407985006", "created_at": "2026-11-03T20:23:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117714341092823204"], "id": "2117714341092823204", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 9, "impression_count": 1816, "like_count": 37, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "How do you calculate a conventional superconductor’s characterizing quantities when first-principles calculations are computationally impractical? Researchers detail a new formalism that could make it easier to identify new superconductors. \n\nLearn more: https://t.co/PIWninbO91 https://t.co/LgnktOhvI9", "url": "https://x.com/PhysicsMagazine/status/2117714341092823204"}, {"author_id": "3290364847", "created_at": "2026-11-03T20:15:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117712262530011217"], "id": "2117712262530011217", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1785, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "What happens to MAHA after today's election? That's what STAT's Isa Cueto will be watching. https://t.co/M3U3Ux2QYr", "url": "https://x.com/statnews/status/2117712262530011217"}, {"author_id": "32372834", "created_at": "2026-11-03T20:14:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117711924427165878"], "id": "2117711924427165878", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 58, "impression_count": 27993, "like_count": 208, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 29}, "text": "\"In the end, I have come to realize that being authentic at work is not a weakness, but rather a strength.\" #ScienceMagArchives https://t.co/xXF9s1QUnj https://t.co/biBDCNhJR2", "url": "https://x.com/ScienceMagazine/status/2117711924427165878"}, {"author_id": "3290364847", "created_at": "2026-11-03T19:44:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117704610324341042"], "id": "2117704610324341042", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2257, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "The MAHA movement was nearly invisible on the campaign trail and struggled to find a financial or messaging foothold in key races. To some of its most vocal supporters, the very soul of MAHA is at stake today. https://t.co/RgMp3IMt5a", "url": "https://x.com/statnews/status/2117704610324341042"}, {"author_id": "32372834", "created_at": "2026-11-03T18:57:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117692548986577185"], "id": "2117692548986577185", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 12421, "like_count": 19, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "Without #ClimateChange, flood peaks in Europe from Storm Boris would have been as much as 22% lower, new models suggest in @ScienceAdvances. https://t.co/Q96Mn6ZmEy https://t.co/9Tu5lGjabp", "url": "https://x.com/ScienceMagazine/status/2117692548986577185"}, {"author_id": "15862891", "created_at": "2026-11-03T18:44:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117689400544858134"], "id": "2117689400544858134", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 11, "impression_count": 12550, "like_count": 64, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 38}, "text": "Two years ago, countries at a UN biodiversity summit agreed that companies profiting from Earth’s genetic data should pay to help preserve nature. So far they’ve contributed just US$10,588.\n\nhttps://t.co/2MPtF5l4Pi", "url": "https://x.com/Nature/status/2117689400544858134"}, {"author_id": "86626845", "created_at": "2026-11-03T18:08:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117680240172659031"], "id": "2117680240172659031", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 74, "impression_count": 26005, "like_count": 114, "quote_count": 11, "reply_count": 26, "retweet_count": 26}, "text": "Utah is leading the country, way out in front, for consumer health AI company offerings, approving multiple pilots. None have published a peer review paper. One is selling their own proprietary products as part of its \"end-to-end\" AI healthcare. https://t.co/IJFU9Yp2kb", "url": "https://x.com/EricTopol/status/2117680240172659031"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "28164923", "name": "WSJ Markets", "username": "WSJmarkets"}, {"id": "32372834", "name": "Science Magazine", "username": "ScienceMagazine"}, {"id": "207256884", "name": "John Preskill", "username": "preskill"}, {"id": "3290364847", "name": "STAT", "username": "statnews"}, {"id": "860158302", "name": "Quanta Magazine", "username": "QuantaMagazine"}, {"id": "14499829", "name": "World Health Organization (WHO)", "username": "WHO"}, {"id": "407985006", "name"